<item>
            <title>[LU-20911] LFSCK: add EC layout consistency verification</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20911</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;The LFSCK should be able to validate EC layout constraints:&lt;br/&gt;
parity layout &#8596; data layout bidirectional link, matching extent and stripe_size,&lt;br/&gt;
geometry (dstripe/cstripe non-zero, k+p &#8804; 256, self-consistent ec_split_stripes, parity stripe_count = (n0+n1) * cstripe &#8804; data stripes),&lt;br/&gt;
parity mirror must not mix non-parity components and must start at the mirror boundary. etc&lt;/p&gt;</description>
